Using the steam of your generators you shape it into a psionic fog that lasts [3, 4, 5, 6, 7 (TL1-5)] turns. Any foes caught inside will take [44, 59, 70, 80, 89 (TL1-5; MP 100)] damage per turn and be seared, reducing their fire resistance by [10%, 16%, 21%, 26%, 30% (TL1-5)] and and mind save by [10, 16, 21, 26, 30 (TL1-5)].

The damage will increase with your Mindpower.
